{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"distributive property distributive property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md","fileName":"Distributive Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Distributive Property","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Number Systems and Arithmetic]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Number Systems and Arithmetic","Polynomial Expansion","Combining Like Terms","Polynomial Factorization","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"distributive property distributive property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md","fileName":"Distributive Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Distributive Property","heading":"Distributive Property","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The distributive property connects multiplication with addition:\n\n$$a(b+c)=ab+ac,$$\n\nand similarly ((a+b)c=ac+bc). A factor outside parentheses multiplies every term inside them.\n\nDistribution is the basis of [[Polynomial Expansion]] and [[Combining Like Terms]]. Used in reverse, it becomes [[Polynomial Factorization]] because a repeated factor can be taken outside a sum. The rule does not imply that every operation distributes over addition; for example, ((a+b)^2) is generally not (a^2+b^2) because expansion also produces the cross term (2ab).","tags":["baby"],"links":["Number Systems and Arithmetic","Polynomial Expansion","Combining Like Terms","Polynomial Factorization","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"distributive property distributive property","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Distributive Property.md","fileName":"Distributive Property.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Distributive Property","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Number Systems and Arithmetic","Polynomial Expansion","Combining Like Terms","Polynomial Factorization","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}